        "summary": "The Addams Family: Pugsley's Scavenger Hunt is a video game featuring The Addams Family characters from the 1992 animated series.\n\nThe game is a side scrolling platformer adventure game that plays in a very similar way to the previous Addams Family title. The game plays in a non-linear way in so much that the player can choose which level to attempt by entering whichever door they choose in the Addams house.",
