      {
        "id": 38432,
        "name": "Street Combat",
        "summary": "KNOCK-OUT ACTION FOR 2 PLAYERS AT ONCE!\n\nYour Mission...Seek out and destroy a group of ruthless villains who'll stop at nothing to wipe you off the map. Each brutal renegade is a wizard at martial arts and trick moves. You must battle six deadly foes until you confront your greatest challenge-their master, the diabolical C.J.\n\nPunch, leap, somersault and kick your way over skyscraper beams, through the jungle, gritty back alleys, a wrestling ring, the top of a truck, and more. You've never punched-up so much pure action and exciting game play.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3so9.jpg",
