        "id": 42602,
        "name": "Dr. Mario World House Calls",
        "summary": "Dr. Mario World House Calls is a rom hack of Super Mario World. The main character is now Dr. Mario. It features custom blocks, graphics, overworld, and sprites. The difficulty is medium.",
