      {
        "id": 247183,
        "name": "'The",
        "summary": "Mario goes on another quest to save the kingdom. What obstacles will he be facing this time?\n\n'the (also known as Coronation Day) is a Horror themed Super Mario World ROM Hack released in January 2016. The hack features Mario in a forest like environment, with various messages coming from a strange, disembodied voice, but there's something more to it than that...",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f6p.jpg",
