      {
        "id": 260101,
        "name": "R-Ack",
        "summary": "R-Ack (Pronounced \"Are Ah-ck\") is a \"No Rules\" collaboration similar to the Yumps and the VIPs where there is no level design standard. The title has a hidden meaning, referencing the abstract term \"RomhACK\" where anything goes so long as it's a romhack.\n\nFeaturing 35+ levels that totals to 50 exits. Set aside your expectations, as this hack is anything but normal. Actually, inside the chaos could be something normal? Who knows.\n\nYou control an entity known as \"The Plumber\" in search to find the good in the world of R-ACK. Your mission is to simply traverse the landscapes.",
