      {
        "id": 265881,
        "name": "Ayrton Senna Racing",
        "summary": "A rom hack of Nigel Mansell World Championship released for SNES.\n\nThe entirety of the game is identical to the original game, featuring 16 tracks from the 1992 Formula One World Championship season except that all text has been translated to Brazilian Portuguese and all Nigel Mansell-related graphics have been replaced with Ayrton Senna's. The introduction/opening credits are also replaced with Ayrton Senna's career summary from lower-level motorsports up to his 1993 season with McLaren.",
