      {
        "id": 276880,
        "name": "Golden Yoshi's Island",
        "summary": "Golden Yoshi's Island is a ROM Hack of Yoshi's Island built to be played for live audiences in a speedrunning setting. It's a modified version of SMW2+2 by Golden Yoshi (with his full consent).\n\nThis hack features several optimizations to make it a faster run than its source material, based on feedback from the Yoshi speedrunning community:\n\n-36 levels hand-picked from the original ROM Hack's 50 and rearranged into 4 worlds.\n-Default egg aim setting is now Hasty\n-Transformation sequence has been sped up\n-World-clear cutscene has been removed\n-Message box upon collecting first flower has been removed\n-Autoscrolling sections removed\n-New tech to skip vehicle sections\n-Various other sections of levels have been modified for brevity and consistency\n-Entering the top secret code now triggers the credits sequence\n-Brand new title screen and credits sequence, courtesy of Mattrizzle",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rgo.jpg",
        "release_date": 1533686400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
