      {
        "id": 277055,
        "name": "X-Drive",
        "summary": "A silly 6 years collab project, made by silly dudes, also there's 67 exits\n\nThis hack features levels from 2017 to 2023 with a decent amount of variety among them, with the inspiration from a bunch of other hacks (mostly japanese hacks such as VIP Marios) and some silly ideas we came up with.\nQuality may vary, hopefully you can enjoy it.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dqa.jpg",
        "release_date": 1678924800,
        "rating": null,
