        "id": 277067,
        "name": "Superstar Mario World",
        "summary": "After almost two and a half years, Superstar Mario World is finally finished\n\nThis is a traditional styled hack. With 7 Worlds and over 50 Levels. The plot is your typical Mario plot, but this time, Bowser has also kidnapped the Yoshies and Luigi!",
