      {
        "id": 282871,
        "name": "Stick Mice in My Head and Then Beat My Head in with a Hammer and Let Them Back Out",
        "summary": "\"Well, we psychiatrists have found that over 8% of the population will always be mice, I mean, after all, there's something of the mouse in all of us.\" - Kargol\n\nthis is a short 19 exit hack made at the beginning of winter 2018 c3, meant to showcase a lot of the cool stuff shown off.",
