        "name": "Nabbit Steals Christmas",
        "summary": "Nabbit wants to be on the nice list for once, so he decides to help out a Shining Star asking for his help. Nabbit must now gather all of the presents on the island and bring them under the Christmas tree at the Star Shrine!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mz3.jpg",
