      {
        "id": 301788,
        "name": "Nonsense",
        "summary": "Welcome to Nonsense! A variety collab in every sense of the word, this hack features contributions from numerous level authors across the SMW community.\n\nYou’ll encounter many wild gimmicks and strange ideas throughout this hack. However, at its heart, Nonsense is about classic standard platforming. You’ll find very little in the way of puzzles or Kaizo here, but your platforming skills will truly be put to the test.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rij.jpg",
