      {
        "id": 306944,
        "name": "Wolfenstein 3D",
        "summary": "The SNES version of Wolfenstein 3D has modified episodes and storyline, along with heavy censorship. The changes make this version a different game from the original DOS game, and was used as the basis for the Atari Jaguar, Macintosh, 3DO and Apple IIgs ports.\nA Macintosh version would later unite both the SNES storyline and the original DOS storyline in a single release.\n\nThe Japanese version has even more censorship than the Western release, with a storyline changed even further.",
