      {
        "id": 315563,
        "name": "Onegai My Melody: My Melody Adventure",
        "summary": "After reading a book about certain place, Melody embarks in a journey to have an exciting adventure. What dangers await her there?\n\nFirst shown in the Winter C3 of 2023, this was a showcase of a simple spritesheet, and then became his own thing. This was a project of one year, circling back to january of 2023 all the way up to january of 2024.\nWithout further ado, the full thing",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rpr.jpg",
        "release_date": 1714953600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
