      {
        "id": 316124,
        "name": "Bowser's Revenge 4",
        "summary": "Bowser's Revenge 4 has 8 Worlds and an additional Star World, and several unique bosses made specifically for this game. There is quite a fair bit of custom ASM,\nespecially in the Star World, which should make this an interesting experience.\nThe difficulty varies as it's fairly easy in the first few worlds, but\ndifficulty increases a bit past World 6, especially in World 8 and the\nStar World. Unfortunately, I can't choose both Standard: Hard and Standard: Normal, but just know it gets more difficult as the game progresses.\nAs for the bosses, none should be too difficult or too confusing... maybe.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8si3.jpg",
