      },
      {
        "id": 316531,
        "name": "Final Fantasy IV: Daughter of Darkness and Light",
        "summary": "What if the King of Baron had banished Joanna rather than Cecilia? That Kluya meets Joanna, the two fall in love, and they have a son and a daughter? And that, after tragedy strikes, this daughter ends up been abandoned in the woods… only to be found and raised by the King?\n\nA single ripple becomes a wave that sends a pair of lovers down vastly different life paths. Cecil, the White Wizard. Rosa, the Dark Knight. This is her story–one of redemption from the darkness within.\n\n'Final Fantasy IV: Daughter of Darkness and Light' is a fork of the 'Project II: Final Fantasy IV' hack. Not only does it include the bugfixes, restoration of missing content and revised script of the latter mod, but it also an alternate story with Rosa Farrell as the protagonist.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9v54.jpg",
        "release_date": 1631750400,
